extends base

block content
  main.flex-grow.pt-20
    section(class='max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-8 py-section-padding')
      div(class='max-w-3xl mx-auto')
        //- Header
        div.mb-16
          span(class='text-primary font-label-lg uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 block') Legal
          h1(class='font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface mb-4') Privacy Policy
          p(class='font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant') Last updated: January 1, 2026

        //- Content
        div(class='space-y-12 prose-natours')
          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') info
              | Introduction
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p Natours Adventure ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting and respecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or book our adventure tours.
              p By accessing or using our services, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy. If you do not agree, please do not access or use our services.

          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') database
              | Information We Collect
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p We collect several types of information for various purposes to provide and improve our services to you:
              div(class='bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3')
                div(class='flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] mt-0.5') person
                  div
                    p.font-bold.text-on-surface Personal Data
                    p Name, email address, phone number, billing address, and payment information when you create an account or book a tour.
                div(class='flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] mt-0.5') devices
                  div
                    p.font-bold.text-on-surface Usage Data
                    p Browser type, IP address, pages visited, time spent on pages, and other diagnostic data collected automatically.
                div(class='flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px] mt-0.5') cookie
                  div
                    p.font-bold.text-on-surface Cookies
                    p We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to maintain your session and preferences.

          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') verified_user
              | How We Use Your Information
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p We use the information we collect to:
              ul(class='list-none space-y-3 pl-0')
                each item in ['Process and manage your tour bookings and payments', 'Send booking confirmations, itinerary updates, and travel documents', 'Provide customer support and respond to inquiries', 'Improve our website, tours, and overall user experience', 'Send promotional communications (with your consent)', 'Comply with legal obligations and protect against fraud']
                  li(class='flex items-start gap-3')
                    span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px] mt-0.5') check_circle
                    span= item

          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') share
              | Information Sharing
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p We do not sell your personal information. We may share your data with:
              ul(class='list-none space-y-3 pl-0')
                each item in ['Payment processors (Stripe) to complete transactions securely', 'Tour guides and local partners necessary for your expedition', 'Law enforcement if required by law or to protect our rights', 'Analytics providers to help us understand usage patterns']
                  li(class='flex items-start gap-3')
                    span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px] mt-0.5') arrow_forward
                    span= item

          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') security
              | Data Security
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p We implement industry-standard security measures including encryption (TLS 1.3), secure password hashing (bcrypt), and regular security audits. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.

          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') gavel
              | Your Rights
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal data:
              div(class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4')
                div(class='bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-4 flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') visibility
                  div
                    p(class='font-bold text-on-surface text-sm') Access
                    p(class='text-sm') Request a copy of all personal data we hold about you.
                div(class='bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-4 flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') edit
                  div
                    p(class='font-bold text-on-surface text-sm') Rectification
                    p(class='text-sm') Request correction of inaccurate personal data.
                div(class='bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-4 flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') delete
                  div
                    p(class='font-bold text-on-surface text-sm') Erasure
                    p(class='text-sm') Request deletion of your personal data from our systems.
                div(class='bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg p-4 flex items-start gap-3')
                  span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') block
                  div
                    p(class='font-bold text-on-surface text-sm') Restriction
                    p(class='text-sm') Request that we limit how we use your data.

          section
            h2(class='font-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4 flex items-center gap-3')
              span(class='material-symbols-outlined text-primary') mail
              | Contact Us
            div(class='space-y-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed')
              p If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us:
              div(class='bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2')
                p
                  span.font-bold.text-on-surface Email: 
                  | privacy@natours.io
                p
                  span.font-bold.text-on-surface Address: 
                  | Natours Adventure Ltd, 123 Explorer Avenue, London EC2A 4NE, United Kingdom
